{
  "_comment": "One BatteryPass data model, referenced through two renderings. (1) samm-* = the Battery Pass Consortium SAMM aspect models (github.com/batterypass/BatteryPassDataModel), real published versions 1.2.0 (Performance 1.2.1); these match the skos mappings in battery.ttl and are the canonical form. (2) bpr: = an OpenEPCIS-hosted reference namespace for the few GEFEG BatteryPass-Ready longlist v1.3 attributes with no SAMM equivalent (the DPP-information group #1-#4); GEFEG (thebatterypass.eu / batterypass-ready.gefeg.com) is the Consortium's publication and validation channel and publishes no RDF IRIs. There is no SAMM 1.3.0 and no SAMM DPPInformation submodel.",
